<section class="section question-section"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR QUESTIONS</p><h2>A little more clarity.</h2><details><summary>Will monitoring replace my field visits?</summary><p>No. Measurements add context to your own observations. Your knowledge and field inspections remain essential to understanding your crops.</p></details><details><summary>What will be monitored on my farm?</summary><p>We’ll discuss the available equipment and the conditions relevant to your farm during the pilot conversation, then agree what is practical to monitor.</p></details><details><summary>How do I find out if the pilot is right for me?</summary><p>Express your interest on the pilot page. We’ll discuss your location, growing environment, and priorities as part of assessing suitability.</p></details></section><section class="page-cta"><div><p class="eyebrow">LET’S GROW TOGETHER</p><h2>Bring a new perspective<br />to your farm.</h2></div><a class="button yellow" href="/join-pilot">Join our pilot <span>↗</span></a></section>